{"id":"a169ef2f5263224b","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure.md","title":"Theorem — j-层和分离对象对极限与指数封闭","display":"Theorem — j-层和分离对象对极限与指数封闭","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure","aliases":["14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure"],"display":"Theorem — j-层和分离对象对极限与指数封闭","source_ref":"V.2 Lemma 1, printed pp.224–225; DjVu118","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-df-exponentials]]","[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — j-层和分离对象对极限与指数封闭"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"V.2 Lemma 1, printed pp.224–225; DjVu118"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" href=\"?note=1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" title=\"14-df-j-separated-objects\">14-df-j-separated-objects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" href=\"?note=4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" title=\"14-df-exponentials\">14-df-exponentials</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38500c05a94778d2\" href=\"?note=38500c05a94778d2\" title=\"14-thm-closure-base-change\">14-thm-closure-base-change</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 为 LT 拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,G\">\\(B,G\\)</span> 为对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^B\">\\(G^B\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" href=\"?note=4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" title=\"14-df-exponentials\">14-df-exponentials</a> 选定的指数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:K\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(D:K\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\pi)\">\\((L,\\pi)\\)</span> 是其在环境范畴中实际存在的极限锥。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}\">\\(P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\)</span> 为下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 的两个子集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" href=\"?note=1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" title=\"14-df-j-separated-objects\">14-df-j-separated-objects</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a>，不以未指定的极限对象代替极限锥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_{\\mathrm{sh}}\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\},\\qquad\nP_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_{\\mathrm{sh}}\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\},\\qquad\nP_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall P\\in\\{P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)\\ D(k)\\in P\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow L\\in P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall P\\in\\{P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)\\ D(k)\\in P\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow L\\in P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall P\\in\\{P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\}\\quad G\\in P\\Longrightarrow G^B\\in P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall P\\in\\{P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\}\\quad G\\in P\\Longrightarrow G^B\\in P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>原书 V.2 Lemma 1，印刷224–225页，DjVu118，陈述与证明已比对。命题只处理环境中存在的极限，并不假定任意初等拓扑斯都有全部小极限；有限极限总存在。</p>\n<p>对稠密 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\hookrightarrow E\">\\(m:A\\hookrightarrow E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}(E,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}(E,L)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}(A,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}(A,L)\\)</span> 分别为各分量 Hom 集的极限。分量限制映射的单射或双射性质传到极限；在层的情形，逐分量唯一延拓自动与锥箭头相容。指数转置把对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^B\">\\(G^B\\)</span> 的限制映射化为对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\times1_B\">\\(m\\times1_B\\)</span> 的限制映射；该单射是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 沿投影的拉回，依<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"38500c05a94778d2\" href=\"?note=38500c05a94778d2\" title=\"14-thm-closure-base-change\">14-thm-closure-base-change</a>仍稠密。故分离性和层性都保持。两个对象集合均在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>-范畴内取子集，所写量化不会引入真类量化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-exponentials]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-closure-base-change","status":"resolved","id":"38500c05a94778d2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j$ 为 LT 拓扑，$B,G$ 为对象；$G^B$ 是 [[14-df-exponentials]] 选定的指数。$K$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，$D:K\\to\\mathcal E$ 为函子，$(L,\\pi)$ 是其在环境范畴中实际存在的极限锥。$P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}$ 为下式定义的 $\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$ 的两个子集。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]；$\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)$ 采用 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]，不以未指定的极限对象代替极限锥。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]；$\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)$ 采用 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]，不以未指定的极限对象代替极限锥。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]；$\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)$ 采用 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]，不以未指定的极限对象代替极限锥。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-closure-base-change","status":"resolved","id":"38500c05a94778d2","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对稠密 $m:A\\hookrightarrow E$，$\\mathrm{Hom}(E,L)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Hom}(A,L)$ 分别为各分量 Hom 集的极限。分量限制映射的单射或双射性质传到极限；在层的情形，逐分量唯一延拓自动与锥箭头相容。指数转置把对 $G^B$ 的限制映射化为对 $G$ 沿 $m\\times1_B$ 的限制映射；该单射是 $m$ 沿投影的拉回，依[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]仍稠密。故分离性和层性都保持。两个对象集合均在固定 $\\mathcal V$-范畴内取子集，所写量化不会引入真类量化。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"B,G","display":false},{"tex":"G^B","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"D:K\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)","display":false},{"tex":"P_{\\mathrm{sh}}\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\},\\qquad\nP_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall P\\in\\{P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)\\ D(k)\\in P\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow L\\in P.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall P\\in\\{P_{\\mathrm{sh}},P_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\}\\quad G\\in P\\Longrightarrow G^B\\in P.","display":true},{"tex":"m:A\\hookrightarrow E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}(E,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}(A,L)","display":false},{"tex":"G^B","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"m\\times1_B","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false}],"bytes":2733,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure|thm-276 — j-层和分离对象对极限与指数封闭]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-279","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure|thm-276 — j-层和分离对象对极限与指数封闭]]"},{"id":"592d7bea8469dc16","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8290656b9fd644b8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限极限与指数封闭已在 [[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]] 内建，闭真值分类子由 [[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]] 给出，因此满子范畴满足初等拓扑斯定义。证明不需要先假定层子范畴已经是拓扑斯。左正合反射子另由 [[14-df-separated-reflection-image]] 至 [[14-thm-lt-sheafification-adjunction]] 逐步构造：闭对角取转置、取像得到分离反射，再在层对象中取闭包得到层化。上述是原书证明的内建展开，未作证明助手验证。"},{"id":"5f5d7ce8b2ae609a","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"由[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]及[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]，$W_A=\\Omega_j^A$ 是层；[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]给其子对象 $S_j(A)$ 分离。核对等式可按原书的闭图像论证检验：$\\kappa_Af=\\kappa_Ag$ 等价于 $f,g:B\\to A$ 的闭图像相同；$f$ 的图像包含于 $g$ 的闭图像，拉回后说明 $(g,f)$ 因子化通过闭对角。反向，$\\kappa_A$ 的两复合在对角上相等，又因其目标为层而在稠密的对角闭包上相等。因 $m_A$ 单，$\\kappa_A$ 与 $q_A$ 核对相同。"}],"outgoing":["9135c45b14ec366c","1ff1b9c370bbaad1","55bd5d1a324171ab","4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","38500c05a94778d2"]}